{"id":"incidente","lemma":"incidente","pos":"noun","rank":1876,"glosses":["incident","dispute, quarrel","ancillary proceeding"],"ipa":"/inθiˈdente/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"incidentes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-incidente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Realmente recuerdo el incidente bastante bien.","en":"I do remember the incident quite well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803775","words":[{"g":"really"},{"g":"memory"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"quite"},{"g":"well"}]},{"text":"No he vuelto aquí desde el incidente.","en":"I haven't been back here since the incident.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/616124","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"change"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"No olvidaré este incidente nunca.","en":"I'll never forget this incident.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515870","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to forget","l":"olvidar"},{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"never"}]},{"text":"Había algo extraño en el incidente.","en":"There was something weird about the incident.","words":[{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"something, anything"},{"g":"strange"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"La policía nos informó acerca del incidente.","en":"The police informed us about the incident.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693915","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to inform","l":"informar"},{"g":"only used in acerca de…"},{"g":"of the"},null]}]}